# What the sdist carries beyond the package: the checkout a user needs to run the tests (which read the workflows
# under .github), the bug zoo and the examples, and read the docs. formal/ ships already, as the package data of
# valkey_fuzzer.formal (pyproject.toml maps it), in the wheel too; the wheel's other data is
# tool.setuptools.package-data there. tests/test_packaging.py checks both archives.
include CHANGELOG.md
graft .github
graft docs
graft examples
graft tests
graft zoo
# A checkout the tests ran in has __pycache__ under tests/ and .github/scripts/.
global-exclude *.py[cod]
